====Noun====
{{yo-noun|ìbó}}
# The name for several plants of the family {{w|Apocynaceae}} that are known for their sour taste. They include {{w|Landolphia dulcis}}, Ancylobotrys scandens (from the genus {{taxlink|Ancylobothrys|species}}), {{w|Saba comorensis}}, {{w|Landolphia owariensis}}, and Saba Thompsonii. 
#: {{uxi|yo|ẹmu náàá kan bí '''ìbó'''|t=the palm wine was as sour as the '''ìbó plant'''}}
# {{lb|yo|euphemism}} [[death]]
#: {{uxi|yo|ọmọ́ lọ ká '''ìbó'''|The child is '''dead'''}} ''(Literally: The child went and picked the ìbó plant)''

